"This PC's NVIDIA graphics card is older than the RTX 20 series. Monet draws with its open driver, fine for everyday things; games run best in Windows."
msgstr ""
"Denne PC-ens NVIDIA-skjermkort er eldre enn RTX 20-serien. Monet tegner med den åpne driveren, fint til hverdagsbruk; spill kjører best i Windows."

