msgid "Sign in to your game launchers"
msgstr "Logg på spillklientene dine"

#: crates/monet-bridge/src/cover.rs:312
msgid ""
"Open each one and sign in, with Remember me ticked. Then the games you play from Monet start without asking."
msgstr ""
"Åpne hver av dem og logg på med Husk meg avkrysset. Da starter spillene du spiller fra Monet, uten å spørre."

#: crates/monet-bridge/src/cover.rs:319
msgid "In Windows, then off"
msgstr "I Windows, deretter slås PC-en av"

#: crates/monet-bridge/src/cover.rs:321 crates/monet-bridge/src/cover.rs:357
msgid "Updating your games"
msgstr "Oppdaterer spillene dine"

#: crates/monet-bridge/src/cover.rs:323
msgid ""
"Windows and your game launchers are bringing everything up to date. The PC switches off by itself when they're done."
msgstr ""
"Windows og spillklientene dine oppdaterer alt. PC-en slår seg av automatisk når de er ferdige."

#: crates/monet-bridge/src/cover.rs:327
msgid "Switch off now"
msgstr "Slå av nå"

#: crates/monet-bridge/src/cover.rs:332 crates/monet-bridge/src/cover.rs:358
msgid "Getting %1 ready"
msgstr "Gjør %1 klar"

#: crates/monet-bridge/src/cover.rs:334
msgid ""
"Your game needs it here. Windows installs it once, from what Monet fetched for it, and then your game starts."
msgstr ""
"Spillet ditt trenger det her. Windows installerer det én gang fra det Monet hentet, og så starter spillet."

#: crates/monet-bridge/src/cover.rs:339 crates/monet-bridge/src/cover.rs:359
msgid "Setting up %1"
msgstr "Setter opp %1"

#: crates/monet-bridge/src/cover.rs:341
msgid ""
"Its own installers open here, one after the other. Read their terms and accept them only if you agree: Monet never does that for you, and turns nothing off."
msgstr ""
"Dets egne installasjonsprogrammer åpnes her, ett etter ett. Les vilkårene deres og godta dem bare hvis du er enig: Monet gjør det aldri for deg, og slår ikke av noe."

